        {
          "name": "Flame Blade",
          "description": "As an action, you evoke a fiery blade in your free hand. This magical sword lasts for 1 minute and requires concentration. It counts as a simple melee weapon with which you are proficient. It deals 2d8 fire damage on a hit and has the finesse, light, and thrown properties (range 20/60). In addition, when you use the sword to attack a target that is in bright light, you make the attack roll with advantage. If you drop the weapon or throw it, it dissipates at the end of the turn. You can use a bonus action to cause the sword to reappear in your hand. You can use this trait a number of times equal to your proficiency bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a long rest.",
